                    <Value> Between
Mwalimu National Savings and Credit Cooperative Society Limited a cooperative society registered under the Cooperative Societies Act No. 14 of 1997 Reg. No. CS/2265 and licensed to undertake Sacco business under the Sacco Societies Act 2008, of P.O Box number 62641-00200 Nairobi, Kenya and having its registered office at Mwalimu Towers, Hill Lane off Mara Road (hereinafter called “the Data Controller” which expression shall where the context so requires, include its successors in title and permitted assigns ) of the one part </Value>
